// Title: Suspicious Registry Modification From ADS Via Regini.EXE
// Rule ID: 77946e79-97f1-45a2-84b4-f37b5c0d8682
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.t1112, attack.defense-evasion
// Category: process_creation
